2294	10	update_profile	\N	\N	\N	{"bio": "I traveled to Lombok for a short vacation, and it became one of my most memorable trips. The island welcomed me with beautiful beaches, clear blue water, and warm sunshine. I enjoyed exploring hidden waterfalls, local villages, and tasting traditional Lombok food. The people were very friendly and made me feel at home. Lombok gave me peace, adventure, and unforgettable memories, and I hope to visit again someday.", "name": "Muhammad Yusril Iza Mahendra", "email": "jhonwiknyc@gmail.com", "phone": "0895405088357", "cityId": null}	172.21.0.6	Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36	2026-01-27 08:09:17.16+00
