3387	60	update_profile	\N	\N	\N	{"bio": "I have experience in the tour and travel industry, working in accounting, which helped me understand trip planning from budgeting to logistics. Now, I enjoy writing travel articles and planning trips that are simple, realistic, and well-organized.\\n\\nI love turning ideas into clear itineraries and sharing local experiences in an easy, relatable way. For me, a great trip is all about thoughtful planning and meaningful moments.", "name": "Ike Mulindasari", "email": "ike.mulindasari@gmail.com", "phone": "+628979113435", "cityId": 2, "hostCategories": [4]}	172.21.0.6	Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36	2026-02-08 01:44:48.677+00
