4446	118	update_profile	\N	\N	\N	{"bio": "Hello, my name is Fitri and I live in Bandung. I love traveling and exploring new places. In the past, I’ve worked on city tours in Sumatra and Bangka Belitung, which helped me become very familiar with routes, locations, and using Google Maps efficiently. I would be happy to guide you around Bandung, showing you amazing sights, delicious local food, hidden gems, and the best routes to reach them. I look forward to meeting you soon—nice to meet you and see you around!", "name": "Fitri Febryani Fazrin", "email": "fitrifebryanif@gmail.com", "phone": "081322531454", "cityId": 4, "hostCategories": [4, 1]}	172.21.0.6	Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36	2026-02-09 06:13:20.51+00
