6057	164	update_profile	\N	\N	\N	{"bio": "Born and raised amidst the cool highlands of Bandung, I have a deep-rooted passion for sharing the hidden gems of my city. From the rhythmic clatter of Angklung performances to the secret coffee spots tucked away in Dago, I love creating immersive experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trails. Whether you're a foodie hunting for the best batagor or a history buff exploring Asia-Afrika, I’m here to make sure you fall in love with the 'Paris van Java' just as much as I have.", "name": "Rita Puspitasari", "email": "zenitharutala@gmail.com", "phone": "0895367033890", "cityId": 4, "hostCategories": [4]}	172.21.0.6	Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/138.0.0.0 Safari/537.36	2026-02-12 22:55:27.94+00
