7	6211bdda-7b91-4564-8ea0-191c7b12eebc	Eat Like a Local in Jakarta 🍲 Custom Foodie Itinerary for First-Time Travelers	eat-like-a-local-in-jakarta-custom-foodie-itinerary-for-firsttime-travelers	Planning your first trip to Jakarta can feel overwhelming, especially when you want amazing food, safe places, and authentic local experiences without falling into tourist traps. That’s where I come in!\r\n\r\nI create fun, personalized Jakarta foodie itineraries designed especially for solo travelers and first-time visitors from around the world. You’ll discover hidden culinary gems, must-try local dishes, cozy cafes, and unique food spots loved by locals, all carefully curated with comfort, safety, and practicality in mind.\r\n\r\nYour custom plan includes suggested food routes, local neighborhood insights, travel tips, transportation suggestions, and recommended areas that are solo female–friendly. Whether you’re into street food adventures, aesthetic cafes, local markets, or authentic Indonesian flavors, your itinerary will match your taste, travel pace, and budget.\r\n\r\nThis is a custom trip planning service (no physical guiding), perfect for independent travelers who want to explore Jakarta confidently with a well-organized plan and insider local knowledge.	First time in Jakarta? I’ll design a fun, safe, and personalized foodie itinerary packed with hidden gems, local eats, and solo female–friendly spots. Perfect for curious first-time travelers!	113	4	17	1	100.00	USD	2	2	1	Easy	["1770618516090-952833920.jpg"]	["Buku panduan dan itinerari perjalanan digital kustom (format PDF)", "Sesi konsultasi perencanaan perjalanan secara daring", "Rekomendasi rute kuliner, panduan transportasi lokal, dan tips keamanan khusus solo traveler"]	["Tiket pesawat perjalanan pulang-pergi ke Jakarta", "Pemesanan dan biaya akomodasi atau hotel", "Biaya makanan, minuman, dan belanja pribadi selama wisata", "Biaya transportasi harian di lokasi (taksi, ojek online, atau transportasi umum)", "P