8	f0e0c303-fcd2-43d1-a145-eedfc3273a7d	Mount Sangar Bandung: A Bold Highland Journey	mount-sangar-bandung-a-bold-highland-journey	Mount Sangar in Bandung offers a hiking experience that blends challenge, serenity, and raw natural beauty. The journey begins along forested trails where the cool mountain air and the scent of pine create a calming atmosphere, slowly pulling hikers away from the noise of the city and into the quiet rhythm of nature.\r\n\r\nAs the trail ascends, the path becomes more adventurous, weaving through dense vegetation and open ridgelines that reveal sweeping views of the surrounding highlands. Each step upward feels like a small victory, with every turn offering a different perspective—rolling hills, distant peaks, and endless stretches of green landscapes that define the mountains of West Java.\r\n\r\nApproaching the higher sections, the scenery opens dramatically. The wind grows stronger, the air cooler, and the horizon wider. At sunrise, the mountain transforms into a breathtaking panorama of golden light touching the ridges and valleys below, creating a moment of stillness that feels both humbling and inspiring.\r\n\r\nClimbing Mount Sangar is not only about reaching the summit; it is about embracing the journey—the shared laughter along the trail, the quiet pauses to catch your breath, and the realization that every challenging step leads to unforgettable views. For those seeking adventure close to Bandung, Mount Sangar offers a perfect escape into the wild, where endurance meets beauty and every climb becomes a memorable story.	Discover the wild beauty of Mount Sangar, Bandung—an adventurous trail surrounded by fresh mountain air, lush landscapes, and breathtaking views that reward every step of the journey.	109	2	2	4	15.00	USD	4	10	1	Easy	["1770619089610-386065282.jpg", "1770619089612-657252100.jpg", "1770619089614-891534231.jpg", "1770619089616-665984380.jpg", "1770619089617-221722062.jpg", "1770619089618-109433360.jpg"]	["Pemandu lokal