5	fb80c079-2689-406f-90e6-12037a75cd89	Hidden Gems of Goa Cina Beach: A Calm Coastline Curated by a Malang Local🏖	hidden-gems-of-goa-cina-beach-a-calm-coastline-curated-by-a-malang-local	Goa Cina is one of those places that quietly steals your attention. I grew up in Malang, and this beach has always been my reset button. The waves move with a steady rhythm, the rock formations rise like natural sculptures, and there’s a peaceful pocket of shoreline that most visitors never even notice.\r\n\r\nI’ll design an itinerary that lets you experience Goa Cina the way locals truly cherish it. That includes the best time to arrive for soft morning light, the hidden corner that’s perfect for photos without crowds, and nearby small stalls serving warm coconut water and simple seafood that somehow tastes richer after breathing in the ocean air.\r\n\r\nAnd if you stay until late afternoon, you’ll reach my favorite lookout point for sunset. It’s a calm perch facing the open horizon, where the sky melts into warm colors and the sound of the waves becomes its own soundtrack. Many beaches in Malang offer sunsets, but this one feels like a quiet secret.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a beach visit. It’s a scenic, effortless day curated by someone who has returned to this coastline countless times. Let me help you shape a journey that captures the soul of Malang’s southern coast. 🌤️🌅	A hand-crafted escape to one of Malang’s most underrated coastlines, complete with the perfect spot to catch one of the city’s most stunning sunsets. 🌊🌅	81	4	23	9	25.00	USD	4	10	1	Easy	["1770563732341-543458507.jpg", "1770563732343-81827307.jpg", "1770563732344-422465557.jpg", "1770563732346-36516362.jpg", "1770563732347-402288439.jpg", "1770563732348-304553882.jpg"]	["Sesi konsultasi perencanaan perjalanan privat dengan warga lokal Malang", "Buku panduan perjalanan digital (PDF Itinerary) yang dipersonalisasi"]	["Pemesanan dan biaya akomodasi / penginapan hotel", "Tiket transportasi, sewa kendaraan, atau akomod