jati.	["Sepatu trekking atau sandal gunung yang nyaman dan tidak licin", "Pakaian ganti dan baju yang nyaman untuk aktivitas luar ruangan", "Tabir surya (sunscreen), topi pelindung, dan kacamata hitam", "Obat-obatan pribadi atau antinyamuk", "Kamera atau ponsel dengan baterai terisi penuh untuk berfoto", "Uang tunai secukupnya untuk keperluan pribadi"]	Tetebatu Scenic Walking Tour: Rice Terraces, Hidden Waterfall & Monkey Forest	Jelajah Keindahan Tetebatu: Sawah Terasering, Air Terjun, dan Hutan Monyet	["Penjemputan nyaman di hotel dan perjalanan santai menuju Desa Tetebatu di lereng Gunung Rinjani.", "Trekking menyusuri hamparan sawah terasering hijau sambil menikmati megahnya pemandangan Gunung Rinjani dan mempelajari kearifan lokal.", "Petualangan seru melintasi jalur pedesaan alami, menyeberangi aliran sungai kecil, dan menjelajahi hutan menuju air terjun yang menyegarkan.", "Mengunjungi kawasan Monkey Forest untuk melihat satwa di habitat aslinya dan menikmati hidangan makan siang khas lokal sebelum diantar kembali ke hotel."]
11	121bca6b-7a85-41f5-a117-7535a3d46e14	Mount Wayang, Bandung: A Highland Adventure Escape	mount-wayang-bandung-a-highland-adventure-escape	Mount Wayang in Bandung offers a refreshing mountain escape, perfect for those seeking both adventure and tranquility close to the city. The journey begins through scenic highland paths surrounded by lush greenery, where cool mountain air and the gentle sounds of nature immediately create a calming atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAs hikers move deeper into the trail, the landscape gradually reveals rolling hills, open ridgelines, and panoramic views of the surrounding mountains. The route is known for its peaceful environment, making every step feel enjoyable rather than rushed, allowing visitors to fully experience the beauty of West Java’s highland scenery.\r\n\r\nReaching higher elevations, the horizon opens wider, offering breathtaking viewpoints that become even more magical during sunrise. Golden sunlight slowly illuminates the valleys, hills, and distant peaks, creating a moment of quiet reflection that many hikers consider the highlight of the journey.\r\n\r\nClimbing Mount Wayang is not only about reaching the summit, but also about enjoying the peaceful process along the way—the conversations shared on the trail, the pauses to take in the scenery, and the feeling of reconnecting with nature. For travelers looking for a short yet memorable mountain adventure in Bandung, Mount Wayang offers an experience filled with fresh air, scenic beauty, and unforgettable moments.	Escape to the refreshing highlands of Mount Wayang, Bandung—where peaceful trails, cool mountain air, and scenic landscapes create a perfect adventure for nature lovers.	109	2	2	4	12.00	USD	4	10	1	Easy	["1770622478089-613212114.jpg", "1770622478090-197046805.jpg", "1770622478091-524008293.jpg", "1770622478092-500294590.jpg", "1770622478093-653666929.jpg"]	["Pemandu lokal berlisensi dan berpengalaman", "Tiket masuk resmi kawasan Gunung Wayang", "Dokumentasi foto selama p