1	What is LocallyTrip?	LocallyTrip is a travel platform that connects travelers with local hosts and guides for authentic, personalized experiences. Our platform offers curated tours, photography sessions, local insights, and travel planning services across Indonesia and beyond.	general	t	t	1	0	0	["platform", "about", "travel"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00
2	How does LocallyTrip work?	LocallyTrip works in simple steps: 1) Browse experiences by location or category, 2) Choose your preferred host and package, 3) Book and pay securely through our platform, 4) Meet your host and enjoy your authentic local experience, 5) Leave a review to help other travelers.	general	t	t	2	0	0	["how-to", "process", "booking"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00
3	What types of experiences are available?	We offer four main types of experiences: Local Tour Guide (guided tours with cultural insights), Photographer (professional photo sessions), Combo (guided tours + photography), and Trip Planner (custom itinerary design). Each experience is crafted by verified local hosts.	general	t	t	3	0	0	["experiences", "types", "services"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00
4	Is LocallyTrip safe and trustworthy?	Yes! All our hosts are verified through identity checks and background verification. We provide secure payment processing, 24/7 customer support, and comprehensive insurance coverage. Our review system ensures transparency and quality control.	general	t	f	4	0	0	["safety", "trust", "verification"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00
5	What locations does LocallyTrip cover?	We primarily focus on Indonesia (Bali, Jakarta, Yogyakarta, Borobudur) with expanding coverage to Southeast Asia. Our hosts provide experiences in major tourist destinations as well as hidden gems known only to locals.	general	t	f	5	0	0	["locations", "coverage", "indonesia"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43131+00
6	How do I book an experience?	To book: 1) Select your desired experience and date, 2) Choose participant count and any add-ons, 3) Provide your contact details, 4) Complete payment securely, 5) Receive confirmation with host contact information. You can book up to 24 hours in advance.	traveller	t	t	1	0	0	["booking", "how-to", "process"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.433582+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.433582+00
7	Can I customize my experience?	Absolutely! Most hosts are flexible and can customize experiences based on your interests, fitness level, dietary restrictions, or special requests. Contact the host directly after booking or mention your preferences during the booking process.	traveller	t	t	2	0	0	["customization", "flexibility", "preferences"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.433582+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.433582+00
8	What should I bring for my experience?	Each experience listing includes a "What to Bring" section. Generally: comfortable walking shoes, sun protection, camera, water bottle, and any personal medications. For photography sessions, bring preferred outfits. Hosts provide specialized equipment.	traveller	t	f	3	0	0	["preparation", "items", "what-to-bring"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.433582+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.433582+00
9	What if weather affects my experience?	Hosts monitor weather conditions and will contact you if changes are needed. Indoor alternatives are usually available, or you can reschedule without penalty up to 12 hours before your experience. Full refunds apply for severe weather cancellations.	traveller	t	f	4	0	0	["weather", "cancellation", "rescheduling"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.433582+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.433582+00
