12	How do I become a LocallyTrip host?	To become a host: 1) Complete our application with your background and expertise, 2) Submit identity verification documents, 3) Create your first experience listing with photos and detailed description, 4) Pass our quality review, 5) Start receiving bookings!	host	t	t	1	0	0	["become-host", "application", "verification"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00
13	What host categories are available?	We offer four host categories: Local Tour Guide (cultural and sightseeing tours), Photographer (professional photo services), Combo (tours + photography), and Trip Planner (custom itinerary design). Choose the category that matches your expertise.	host	t	t	2	0	0	["host-categories", "services", "expertise"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00
14	How much can I earn as a host?	Host earnings vary by experience type, location, and season. Local guides earn $30-80/day, photographers $40-120/session, combo hosts $60-150/day, and trip planners $25-75/itinerary. You keep 85% of booking fees after our 15% service charge.	host	t	t	3	0	0	["earnings", "commission", "income"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00
15	When and how do I get paid?	Payments are released 24 hours after experience completion. Funds are transferred to your registered bank account or PayPal within 3-5 business days. You can track all earnings through your host dashboard and download payment reports.	host	t	f	4	0	0	["payments", "payout", "timeline"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00
16	What support does LocallyTrip provide hosts?	We provide: host training materials, photography tips, listing optimization guidance, 24/7 customer support, dispute resolution assistance, promotional opportunities, and access to host community forums for peer support and networking.	host	t	f	5	0	0	["host-support", "training", "community"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00
17	How do I handle difficult guests?	Our host guidelines provide strategies for managing challenging situations. You can contact our support team immediately for assistance. We investigate all reported issues and may remove problematic guests from the platform to protect our host community.	host	t	f	6	0	0	["guest-management", "support", "safety"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.434232+00
18	What payment methods are accepted?	We accept Visa, Mastercard, PayPal, and major Indonesian payment methods (BCA, Mandiri, BNI, DANA, OVO, GoPay). All transactions are secured with SSL encryption and PCI DSS compliance for your financial protection.	payment	t	t	1	0	0	["payment-methods", "visa", "mastercard", "paypal"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00
19	Is my payment information secure?	Yes! We use bank-level security with 256-bit SSL encryption. Payment details are processed through certified payment gateways (Stripe, PayPal) and never stored on our servers. We are PCI DSS compliant and regularly security audited.	payment	t	t	2	0	0	["security", "ssl", "pci-dss", "encryption"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00
20	When is my card charged?	Your payment method is charged immediately upon booking confirmation. For experiences booked more than 7 days in advance, we offer split payments: 50% at booking, 50% closer to your experience date (for bookings over $100).	payment	t	f	3	0	0	["charging", "payment-timing", "split-payment"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00
21	Can I get a refund if I cancel?	Refund policies vary by host and timing: Full refund (24+ hours before), 50% refund (12-24 hours before), No refund (less than 12 hours). Host cancellations always receive full refunds. Processing takes 3-5 business days.	payment	t	t	4	0	0	["refunds", "cancellation", "policy"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00
22	Why was my payment declined?	Common reasons: insufficient funds, expired card, incorrect billing information, international transaction restrictions, or bank security holds. Try a different payment method or contact your bank to authorize international transactions.	payment	t	f	5	0	0	["payment-declined", "troubleshooting", "bank"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00
23	How do PayPal payments work?	PayPal payments redirect you to secure PayPal checkout. You can pay with your PayPal balance, linked bank account, or cards saved in PayPal. PayPal provides additional buyer protection and easier refund processing for international transactions.	payment	t	f	6	0	0	["paypal", "checkout", "international"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.4349+00
24	How do I use a promo code?	Enter your promo code in the "Promo Code" field during checkout before completing payment. The discount will be automatically applied to your total. Promo codes cannot be applied after booking is completed.	booking	t	t	1	0	0	["promo-code", "discount", "how-to-use"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00
25	Can I combine multiple promo codes?	Most promo codes cannot be combined unless specifically stated. The system will apply the highest available discount. Some special promotional codes (like first-time user + category discounts) can be stacked - this will be clearly indicated.	booking	t	f	2	0	0	["multiple-codes", "stacking", "combination"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00
26	Why isn't my promo code working?	Common issues: code expired, minimum purchase requirement not met, code already used (single-use), experience category excluded, or typos in code entry. Check code terms and conditions or contact support for assistance.	booking	t	t	3	0	0	["promo-code-issues", "troubleshooting", "expired"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00
27	What types of promo codes are available?	We offer: Welcome codes (first-time users), Category codes (specific experience types), Seasonal codes (holidays, special events), Loyalty codes (returning customers), and Referral codes (invite friends). Follow our social media for latest codes.	booking	t	f	4	0	0	["promo-types", "seasonal", "loyalty", "referral"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00
28	Do promo codes expire?	Yes, all promo codes have expiration dates and usage limits. Check the code terms for specific validity periods. Expired codes cannot be reactivated. Subscribe to our newsletter or follow social media for new promotional offers.	booking	t	f	5	0	0	["expiration", "validity", "terms"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.43562+00
29	How do I join Vibes Forum discussions?	Create your LocallyTrip account and complete your profile. Access Vibes Forum through the main menu. You can browse categories, search topics, post questions, share travel tips, and engage with the community. Build reputation points through helpful contributions.	technical	t	t	1	0	0	["vibes-forum", "community", "discussions"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00
30	What are Vibes Forum reputation points?	Reputation points are earned through community engagement: posting helpful content (+5), receiving likes on posts (+2), providing best answers (+10), and consistent participation (+1 daily). Higher reputation unlocks special privileges and recognition badges.	technical	t	f	2	0	0	["reputation-points", "gamification", "badges"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00
31	How do Vibes Meetups work?	Browse upcoming travel meetups by destination, create your own meetup event, or join existing groups. Specify your travel dates, interests, and group preferences. Connect with like-minded travelers, share costs, and enhance your travel experiences through community.	technical	t	t	3	0	0	["vibes-meetups", "group-travel", "community"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00
32	Can I create my own travel meetup?	Yes! Click "Create Meetup" in Vibes section, specify destination, dates, group size limits, activities planned, and budget range. Set it as public (open to all) or private (invitation only). Manage member requests through your meetup dashboard.	technical	t	f	4	0	0	["create-meetup", "group-management", "travel-planning"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00
33	How do I report inappropriate content?	Use the "Report" button on any post, comment, or message that violates community guidelines. Our moderation team reviews reports within 24 hours. Serious violations may result in content removal and account restrictions. Help us maintain a positive community environment.	technical	t	f	5	0	0	["reporting", "moderation", "community-guidelines"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00
34	What if I have technical issues with the platform?	For technical support: check our Help Center first, try clearing browser cache/cookies, ensure stable internet connection, or try a different browser. Contact support through live chat, email (support@locallytrip.com), or WhatsApp (+62 812 3456 7890) for immediate assistance.	technical	t	t	6	0	0	["technical-support", "troubleshooting", "help"]	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00	2025-12-29 09:50:56.436193+00
