142	162	204	\N	Jagalchi Fish Market sounds like such an authentic Busan experience. I love how you described the connection between the seafood, the fishermen, and the local people. It feels like a place where you can really understand the culture, not just visit a tourist spot.	t	2026-07-20 07:17:20.776+00	2026-07-20 07:17:20.776+00	f	\N
143	162	199	\N	I visited Busan before, but I didn’t get the chance to explore Jagalchi Market. After reading this story, I definitely want to add it to my next itinerary. Fresh seafood with a harbor view sounds like an unforgettable experience.	t	2026-07-20 07:17:51.79+00	2026-07-20 07:17:51.79+00	f	\N
145	162	193	\N	I’m curious about the seafood experience there. Is it easy for foreign travelers to order at Jagalchi Market if they don’t speak Korean?	t	2026-07-20 07:18:47.666+00	2026-07-20 07:18:47.666+00	f	\N
146	162	200	142	Thank you for sharing this! I totally agree, places like Jagalchi are special because they show the real daily life of a city. The food becomes more meaningful when you know the stories and people behind it.	t	2026-07-20 07:19:48.237+00	2026-07-20 07:19:48.237+00	f	\N
147	162	200	143	You should definitely visit next time! The atmosphere is what makes Jagalchi memorable. Walking around the market, seeing the local activity, and trying fresh seafood is such a unique Busan experience.	t	2026-07-20 07:19:57.984+00	2026-07-20 07:19:57.984+00	f	\N
148	162	200	144	Exactly! Sometimes the smallest moments become the ones we remember the longest. Local markets are amazing because they let us experience a destination through its people, traditions, and everyday life.	t	2026-07-20 07:20:11.469+00	2026-07-20 07:20:11.469+00	f	\N
149	162	200	145	Yes, many visitors still enjoy the experience even without speaking Korean. Simple gestures, menus, translation apps, and friendly vendors usually help a lot. It’s part of the adventure and makes the experience even more memorable!	t	2026-07-20 07:20:23.314+00	2026-07-20 07:20:23.314+00	f	\N
150	173	212	135	Benar kak apa lagi perjalanannya menuju air terjun sungguh tantangan yang bikin tak terlupakan,darii tantangan itu terbayar sudah surganya keindahaan air terjunnya.	t	2026-07-20 23:56:38.314+00	2026-07-20 23:56:38.314+00	f	\N
151	175	212	138	Tapi disana ada ojek becak kalau mau sampek puncak tapi tarifnya mahal per orang Rp 500.000 - Rp 1 juta kalau nggak salah.\nKalau mau kesana harus bener-bener kuat kan fisik aja.	t	2026-07-20 23:59:34.866+00	2026-07-20 23:59:34.866+00	f	\N
152	175	212	136	Sama-sama kak hanya berbagi dari pengalaman sayaa ajaa.	t	2026-07-21 00:01:18.538+00	2026-07-21 00:01:18.538+00	f	\N
153	161	18	\N	Mbaaaaa, this story is so sweet! 🥰 \nBali Farm House looks like the perfect place for a family day. I can imagine how excited Naura was seeing the animals for the first time.\nLove how you shared that traveling is not only about the destination, but also about the memories we create with our family❤️ \nCan’t wait to see more of your travel stories! ✨	t	2026-07-21 12:14:32.707+00	2026-07-21 12:14:32.707+00	f	\N
