looming flowers is enough.\n\n\n## Let’s Discuss 👇\n\n👉🏻 What would your ideal romantic setup at Auckland Botanic Gardens look like?\n\n👉🏻 Would you go minimal or add special touches?\n\n👉🏻 Do you think romance needs a budget, or just intention?\n\nCurious to hear your thoughts and experiences 🤍	f	f	f	77	0	0	\N	\N	active	[]	55	Planning a Romantic Date at Auckland Botanic Gardens — Ho...	![Image](/images/stories/content/content-1771036268201-34116856.jpg)\n\n\n I’ve been thinking about planning a simple yet meaningful romantic experience at Auck...	AucklandBotanicGardens, RomanticTravel, AucklandDateIdeas, NewZealandTravelBudget, CoupleExperience, PicnicDate, BudgetDiscussion	\N	2026-02-14 02:33:55.247+00	2026-10-13 00:18:58.925+00	0
