28	16	28	Hi @phamhuanglong ! Thanks for joining. The route will be relaxed to moderate, so it’s suitable for beginners as well. We’ll take our time, enjoy the scenery, and have breaks along the way. It’s more about enjoying nature and meeting fellow travelers rather than rushing to finish the trail.	[]	f	2026-07-16 08:50:29.861+00	2026-07-16 08:50:29.861+00
